{"id":"macaco","lemma":"macaco","pos":"noun","rank":1583,"glosses":["monkey; ape","ape; savage (an uncivilised or unruly person)","monster; freak (a hideous person)"],"ipa":"/mɐˈka.ku/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"macacos","feminine":"macaca","femininePlural":"macacas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-macaco.wav","examples":[{"text":"Você viu algum macaco ontem?","en":"Did you see any monkeys yesterday?","words":[{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"to see","l":"ver"},{"g":"some, any"},null,{"g":"yesterday"}]},{"text":"Eu queria ver os macacos.","en":"I wanted to see the monkeys.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ele parece um macaco.","en":"He looks like a monkey.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to seem","l":"parecer"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"De que espécie são esses macacos?","en":"What kind of monkeys are those?","words":[{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"species"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"that, that one","l":"esse"},null]},{"text":"O macaco caiu da árvore.","en":"The monkey fell from the tree.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to fall","l":"cair"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"tree"}]}]}